WEBVTT

00:11.968 --> 00:18.016
♪Listen to the cicadas in the midsummer♪

00:18.944 --> 00:21.653
♪The reflection in your eyes♪

00:22.498 --> 00:27.040
♪A brilliant scenery♪

00:27.744 --> 00:33.518
♪Moonlight spills over
the endless clear sky♪

00:34.349 --> 00:42.496
♪The roar of the heartbeat
leaves a trace behind♪

00:44.032 --> 00:49.566
♪Crush, when night meets dawn♪

00:51.616 --> 00:57.786
♪Crush, rushing to you in the crowd♪

00:59.520 --> 01:02.624
♪Baby, fall in my heart♪

01:03.040 --> 01:07.085
♪Fervent, boiling love♪

01:07.776 --> 01:11.760
♪How you long for the future♪

01:12.128 --> 01:15.328
♪Charging recklessly, getting hurt♪

01:15.520 --> 01:18.475
♪Fall in my heart♪

01:18.475 --> 01:22.816
♪If tears fill your eyes♪

01:23.328 --> 01:27.297
♪Let the damp wind stay in memories♪

01:27.566 --> 01:33.940
♪We stand by each other among the crowd♪

01:33.940 --> 01:39.040
=Be Passionately in Love=

01:40.376 --> 01:42.584
=Episode 10=
(Because the Puppy Is Wagging Its Tail)

02:21.376 --> 02:23.376
Similar to the day
we watched the meteor shower?

02:24.455 --> 02:24.975
A little.

02:25.296 --> 02:26.896
But that night was prettier than now.

02:28.216 --> 02:30.736
I should suggest to Mr. Fu
to set up more stargazing spots.

02:31.015 --> 02:32.135
It will profit.

02:33.256 --> 02:34.256
You're great at math.

02:34.656 --> 02:36.135
You might as well major in Finance.

02:37.296 --> 02:38.336
I suppose it's possible.

02:39.816 --> 02:41.015
Why not try

02:41.495 --> 02:42.656
Defense Electronics Tech?

02:43.975 --> 02:45.495
You're so good at keeping secrets.

02:45.856 --> 02:47.776
If I hadn't come
to record the show today,

02:47.975 --> 02:49.256
when were you going to tell me?

02:50.415 --> 02:51.896
My mom used to say I was

02:53.296 --> 02:55.216
the master of being snide,

02:55.696 --> 02:57.216
but I think now it's you.

02:57.216 --> 02:57.736
No.

02:58.015 --> 02:58.817
My dad said

02:58.817 --> 03:00.776
I've always been the best
at being insincere.

03:01.495 --> 03:02.495
Okay.

03:03.656 --> 03:04.656
Five more minutes.

03:06.135 --> 03:08.415
Do you want
to hear my explanation first,

03:08.535 --> 03:09.856
or watch the fireworks first?

03:09.975 --> 03:11.015
No need for explanations.

03:11.095 --> 03:12.575
But I'm really curious,

03:13.336 --> 03:15.896
how did you score 713
just on raw scores?

03:16.336 --> 03:17.336
Just performed normally.

03:20.256 --> 03:21.256
Alright.

03:22.696 --> 03:23.696
Chen Luzhou,

03:24.296 --> 03:25.415
I understand now

03:25.736 --> 03:27.415
why you're always so confident.

03:31.095 --> 03:32.095
Now it's your turn.

03:33.376 --> 03:34.376
You explain.

03:34.935 --> 03:35.935
Explain what?

03:38.856 --> 03:39.856
Why are you avoiding me?

03:40.336 --> 03:41.455
Am I that unsightly?

03:42.495 --> 03:43.297
I just don't want

03:43.297 --> 03:44.935
our relationship to be so complicated.

03:45.376 --> 03:46.495
What do you mean by that?

03:46.615 --> 03:48.495
You want to let me
know your friends, right?

03:50.055 --> 03:51.055
Then what?

03:51.696 --> 03:52.856
Then I realized,

03:52.856 --> 03:54.256
even if you don't come today,

03:54.455 --> 03:55.896
they'd still always talk about you.

03:56.535 --> 03:57.736
If I go to college

03:57.736 --> 03:59.095
and they become my classmates,

03:59.176 --> 04:00.656
they're bound to chat a lot.

04:00.896 --> 04:01.896
Talk about your

04:02.336 --> 04:03.336
high school

04:03.736 --> 04:04.736
glorious deeds.

04:04.896 --> 04:06.575
And your romantic affairs abroad.

04:07.776 --> 04:09.015
Don't want to hear about me?

04:10.415 --> 04:11.415
Why is that?

04:24.760 --> 04:27.050
♪In the darkness,
you are like fireworks♪

04:27.384 --> 04:30.140
♪Unattainable♪

04:30.648 --> 04:32.688
♪How much time is needed♪

04:33.528 --> 04:35.861
♪To vividly sketch♪

04:40.472 --> 04:42.762
♪Peel away the soft shell♪

04:43.288 --> 04:45.698
♪I want to understand your fragility♪

04:47.095 --> 04:48.095
You full?

04:52.856 --> 04:54.256
We are clocks walking alone.

04:54.376 --> 04:57.495
But we have to be clocks
that ring with hope.

04:59.455 --> 05:01.296
Hey, you, watch the copyright.

05:01.296 --> 05:03.336
This is a message
from Luzhou to the juniors.

05:03.336 --> 05:04.696
Be careful not to spoil the fun.

05:04.776 --> 05:05.975
Fine.

05:07.535 --> 05:08.776
Where did Chen Luzhou go?

05:09.095 --> 05:10.216
Why hasn't he come back yet?

05:12.216 --> 05:13.455
Where's Xu Zhi?

05:14.296 --> 05:15.415
Where are the two of them?

05:15.696 --> 05:19.176
They must be studying quantum mechanics.

05:21.624 --> 05:24.049
♪Don't give it an answer♪

05:26.072 --> 05:27.624
♪I'm the same♪

05:29.176 --> 05:32.135
♪Just keep moving forward♪

05:32.135 --> 05:33.135
At this moment,

05:33.296 --> 05:36.216
they must be discussing
quantum entanglement.

05:37.144 --> 05:39.436
♪Yet we are still♪

05:40.856 --> 05:43.252
♪For ages♪

05:47.535 --> 05:48.535
Beautiful.

05:57.736 --> 05:58.736
So?

06:00.256 --> 06:01.256
Why exactly?

06:04.015 --> 06:05.776
Because the puppy is wagging its tail.

06:08.455 --> 06:09.495
What? Because...

06:09.896 --> 06:11.776
Because the school trustee is my mom?

06:12.736 --> 06:14.135
If you didn't hear it, forget it.

06:27.736 --> 06:28.736
Want more?

06:29.376 --> 06:30.376
You still have it?

06:31.336 --> 06:32.816
I've been guarding it all night.

06:34.856 --> 06:36.415
First, tell me what you just said.

06:38.575 --> 06:39.575
I said,

06:40.296 --> 06:42.415
"Chen Luzhou, you're a dog."

06:42.736 --> 06:43.736
Seven words.

06:44.176 --> 06:45.376
You just spoke eight words.

06:45.896 --> 06:46.896
Can calculate mentally?

06:47.336 --> 06:48.816
A little. Compete?

06:48.935 --> 06:49.575
Okay.

06:49.776 --> 06:51.975
I was an abacus mental arithmetic
champion as a child.

06:52.256 --> 06:53.256
Okay.

06:53.615 --> 06:54.656
I'll say a sentence.

06:54.856 --> 06:56.216
Don't count with your fingers.

06:56.535 --> 06:57.656
Just say a few words.

06:58.216 --> 06:59.217
Best of five.

06:59.217 --> 07:00.696
If you lose, give me the wine.

07:01.055 --> 07:02.055
Alright.

07:03.896 --> 07:05.455
Can I have a sip first?

07:12.376 --> 07:13.575
Might as well finish it.

07:13.736 --> 07:14.736
A friendly match?

07:17.376 --> 07:18.376
Sure.

07:18.696 --> 07:19.696
Tastes good.

07:23.935 --> 07:25.095
When you go to Beijing,

07:25.336 --> 07:26.656
will you go drinking with others?

07:28.696 --> 07:29.816
Probably.

07:29.975 --> 07:30.975
Or it'll be boring.

07:35.256 --> 07:36.256
Be safe.

07:36.615 --> 07:37.336
Okay.

07:37.535 --> 07:39.176
Try not to drink with guys.

07:41.415 --> 07:42.415
It's for

07:42.736 --> 07:43.736
your own good.

07:44.736 --> 07:45.736
Can I drink with you?

07:48.095 --> 07:49.095
Still want to play?

07:50.455 --> 07:51.455
Yes.

07:51.535 --> 07:52.535
Come on.

07:58.455 --> 08:00.296
Congrats on becoming the top scorer.

08:00.696 --> 08:02.176
Wishing you a bright future.

08:02.455 --> 08:05.415
Remember not to lie casually
to girls in the future.

08:06.015 --> 08:07.015
You'll repay eventually.

08:07.135 --> 08:08.135
How many words?

08:08.896 --> 08:09.896
Thirty-five words.

08:11.975 --> 08:13.736
You told me not to drink with guys.

08:13.736 --> 08:14.615
What about yourself?

08:14.696 --> 08:16.576
Will you drink with girls
when you go abroad?

08:16.576 --> 08:17.576
How many words?

08:18.576 --> 08:19.576
I won't.

08:20.135 --> 08:21.135
Twenty-six words.

08:26.816 --> 08:29.175
Some people owe a lot of love debts.

08:29.375 --> 08:31.175
They even dare to suspect I'm a player.

08:31.656 --> 08:33.856
You can ask directly in the future.

08:34.215 --> 08:35.375
Don't search on Baidu.

08:35.776 --> 08:36.776
How many words?

08:39.696 --> 08:40.736
Your eyes are sharp.

08:41.616 --> 08:42.736
Wary of scams.

08:42.975 --> 08:44.335
I need to keep my eyes open.

08:45.975 --> 08:47.015
I didn't catch it clearly.

08:47.015 --> 08:48.015
Consider it your win.

08:48.616 --> 08:49.135
Again?

08:49.536 --> 08:51.064
Because the puppy is wagging its tail.

08:51.496 --> 08:52.496
How many words?

08:52.696 --> 08:53.696
Eight words.

08:55.375 --> 08:56.375
That's what you said?

08:59.055 --> 09:00.055
What does it mean?

09:01.095 --> 09:02.095
The literal meaning.

09:02.520 --> 09:04.884
♪Like a breeze♪

09:05.976 --> 09:08.229
♪Drifting through the sky♪

09:09.592 --> 09:13.055
♪It wipes away
the trails of sorrow's sigh♪

09:13.055 --> 09:14.055
Will you say it or not?

09:16.600 --> 09:18.052
♪How many sceneries♪

09:18.656 --> 09:19.896
Don't spill it.

09:20.175 --> 09:22.121
♪Have I passed by♪

09:23.480 --> 09:28.044
♪Waiting for a meeting♪

09:29.304 --> 09:31.754
♪The heartbeat reminds♪

09:31.754 --> 09:35.193
♪The moment I hug you♪

09:35.896 --> 09:38.625
♪Let every chapter of the story♪

09:40.042 --> 09:42.978
♪Align♪

09:45.816 --> 09:48.803
♪Even if it rains on you♪

09:49.351 --> 09:51.983
♪I will always be with you♪

09:53.624 --> 09:56.663
♪Like a rainbow appears♪

09:57.208 --> 09:59.550
♪Our love will last♪

09:59.731 --> 10:02.732
♪Even if it rains on you♪

10:03.229 --> 10:06.062
♪I will always be with you♪

10:07.416 --> 10:10.231
♪I will let you know♪

10:10.936 --> 10:13.647
♪You're the only one♪

10:14.736 --> 10:15.736
It's raining.

10:17.912 --> 10:20.070
♪Parallel distance♪

10:22.200 --> 10:23.391
♪With you♪

10:24.946 --> 10:27.077
♪The splendid, sunny memories♪

10:28.408 --> 10:30.867
♪Mend uneasy dreams♪

10:34.456 --> 10:37.578
♪Even if it rains on you♪

10:37.880 --> 10:41.042
♪I will always be with you♪

10:42.616 --> 10:43.616
(Because...)

10:45.095 --> 10:47.015
(Because the puppy is wagging its tail.)

10:48.055 --> 10:51.496
(The cheers for you will never stop.)

10:52.696 --> 10:55.616
(The rain in Qingyi
may continue to fall all year round.)

10:56.776 --> 11:00.576
(I tell you I like you
in the bustling crowd.)

11:32.536 --> 11:34.856
(I am very happy
to have met so many friends today.)

11:35.175 --> 11:36.456
(Also thank the staff girls)

11:36.456 --> 11:37.496
(and the guy's care.)

11:37.975 --> 11:39.536
(The recording process was delightful.)

11:40.015 --> 11:41.816
(Watching top students chat
is fascinating.)

11:55.295 --> 11:55.935
(In addition,)

11:56.015 --> 11:58.135
(I also met a nice expert,)

11:58.135 --> 11:59.135
(Chen Luzhou.)

11:59.215 --> 12:00.736
(He scored 713 without extra credits.)

12:01.135 --> 12:03.656
(Lu from No.1 High School
is the real deal.)

12:05.295 --> 12:06.736
(Still offended someone.)

12:13.656 --> 12:14.656
(Are you home yet?)

13:12.135 --> 13:14.295
(Because the puppy is wagging its tail.)

13:34.696 --> 13:35.376
(Hi, everyone.)

13:35.376 --> 13:37.255
(I am Xu Zhi from Ruijun High School.)

13:38.135 --> 13:39.016
(Ranked 30th.)

13:39.016 --> 13:41.416
Dad, you've been watching all morning.

13:42.896 --> 13:44.776
I just want to pick a good part.

13:44.776 --> 13:45.856
But it's so long.

13:45.856 --> 13:46.935
Cut which part?

13:47.576 --> 13:49.335
I just want to take it to work.

13:49.656 --> 13:50.856
Let my colleagues see

13:50.856 --> 13:51.856
that my daughter

13:52.375 --> 13:53.416
is not only excellent,

13:53.416 --> 13:54.416
but also photogenic.

13:56.055 --> 13:57.896
Keep it for yourself to enjoy.

13:58.335 --> 13:59.935
Please don't spread it.

14:01.416 --> 14:02.416
What's wrong?

14:02.696 --> 14:03.896
Did anyone bully you

14:03.896 --> 14:04.935
at the TV station?

14:05.335 --> 14:06.896
Do I seem like someone who was bullied?

14:07.255 --> 14:08.536
I'm the one bullying others.

14:09.055 --> 14:10.055
That's true.

14:10.616 --> 14:11.616
Come.

14:14.055 --> 14:15.055
What?

14:15.255 --> 14:15.776
Look.

14:16.135 --> 14:17.496
Ocean Adventure.

14:23.536 --> 14:24.856
You signed me up?

14:26.656 --> 14:27.975
I don't want anything else

14:27.975 --> 14:29.095
besides a computer.

14:30.375 --> 14:31.135
In your room,

14:31.295 --> 14:33.536
a small paper lists ten wishes.

14:34.095 --> 14:36.055
One of them is a spontaneous trip.

14:38.175 --> 14:40.416
Cai and I have already discussed it,

14:40.696 --> 14:42.055
and specially chose this for you.

14:42.175 --> 14:43.496
The Gold Coastline.

14:43.696 --> 14:45.375
Written randomly by Cai Yingying.

14:45.816 --> 14:46.816
Besides,

14:47.095 --> 14:48.816
why not save the money to clear debts?

14:50.736 --> 14:52.055
If you want to spoil the fun,

14:52.055 --> 14:53.536
call Yingying yourself and tell her

14:53.536 --> 14:54.536
you've decided not to go.

14:54.696 --> 14:55.696
I'll tell her.

14:55.776 --> 14:56.776
This is too expensive.

14:59.335 --> 15:00.335
Hello, Yingying.

15:00.536 --> 15:01.295
- You...
- Zhi.

15:01.656 --> 15:03.015
We can go to the sea now.

15:03.576 --> 15:05.616
Oh my,
I bought my swimsuit two years ago.

15:05.816 --> 15:07.295
Finally, it can be used.

15:09.175 --> 15:10.175
Okay.

15:15.255 --> 15:16.416
Thanks, Dad.

15:22.095 --> 15:24.135
(Feng Jin: Who took such a good photo?)

15:24.135 --> 15:25.656
(Could it be me?)

15:28.696 --> 15:29.696
Hey.

15:30.295 --> 15:31.295
Here so early.

15:31.935 --> 15:33.055
Yeah, warm-up.

15:36.416 --> 15:38.215
Cai Yingying and Xu Zhi
are inconsiderate.

15:38.335 --> 15:39.496
Left without a word to play.

15:40.255 --> 15:41.255
What do you mean?

15:41.736 --> 15:43.375
Look. Feng Jin went too.

15:45.375 --> 15:46.375
What is he doing there?

15:47.576 --> 15:49.215
Seems like a one-stop photoshoot.

15:49.736 --> 15:51.496
Maybe Cai Yingying
asked him to take photos.

15:52.496 --> 15:54.335
Photographers are in high demand.

15:56.095 --> 15:57.935
Why didn't Xu Zhi ask you?

15:58.255 --> 15:59.536
Do you think this is a good job?

15:59.975 --> 16:01.616
I need to compete with him for the job?

16:03.215 --> 16:05.576
Lucy, why do I smell a sour odor?

16:06.255 --> 16:07.255
Get lost.

16:11.456 --> 16:12.456
Lucy.

16:13.095 --> 16:14.375
Why do you look like a duck?

16:14.975 --> 16:15.975
Stubborn mouth.

16:27.175 --> 16:28.975
If your vision is poor, get glasses.

16:29.696 --> 16:31.135
The third time. You're hooked, huh?

16:36.135 --> 16:37.135
What's wrong?

16:46.135 --> 16:47.135
Zhu.

16:48.295 --> 16:49.055
What's his deal?

16:49.055 --> 16:50.055
Eat something bad?

16:50.576 --> 16:51.704
Like eating instant noodles

16:51.704 --> 16:52.696
with no noodles,

16:52.696 --> 16:53.696
and only the seasoning.

16:54.215 --> 16:54.817
Go on.

16:54.817 --> 16:55.975
That's really unlucky.

16:56.896 --> 16:58.055
Come on, continue.

17:04.696 --> 17:05.696
Good shot.

17:17.536 --> 17:18.536
Good shot.

17:18.776 --> 17:19.935
Good shot.

17:20.255 --> 17:20.536
Nice.

17:20.536 --> 17:21.335
Let's play again.

17:21.335 --> 17:21.816
Bye-bye.

17:21.975 --> 17:22.536
Play again.

17:22.856 --> 17:24.656
- Next time, buddy.
- Next time.

17:24.656 --> 17:25.656
Bye.

17:25.856 --> 17:26.856
It's him.

17:28.215 --> 17:29.215
The one in the middle?

17:33.975 --> 17:34.857
You're saying

17:34.857 --> 17:36.896
you'll take my buddy
to the eye doctor, right?

17:37.375 --> 17:38.375
Right.

17:39.416 --> 17:40.416
Better hurry up.

17:40.616 --> 17:41.616
If not, you'll go to ER.

17:42.255 --> 17:43.255
Why did you hit me?

17:43.352 --> 17:44.504
Why did you step on my shoe?

17:45.015 --> 17:46.335
What if I hit you while playing?

17:46.456 --> 17:47.856
I did the same, so what?

17:51.135 --> 17:52.375
Quite delicate.

17:57.135 --> 17:58.696
Dressed up like a big shot.

17:58.696 --> 17:59.616
Has a wealthy family.

17:59.696 --> 18:01.255
Do you truly think I won't hit you?

18:01.616 --> 18:02.696
I'm not that rich.

18:03.255 --> 18:04.255
Just my luck,

18:04.616 --> 18:06.135
there's a news producer in the family.

18:06.776 --> 18:08.496
Go ahead if you want to make headlines.

18:11.015 --> 18:11.496
Forget it.

18:11.496 --> 18:12.496
Scared, aren't you?

18:12.816 --> 18:13.697
If you think you can,

18:13.697 --> 18:14.896
go ahead and try.

18:20.496 --> 18:21.536
Beat him.

18:34.712 --> 18:37.862
(Doctor: Cai Binhong)
(Title: Chief Physician)

18:42.776 --> 18:43.816
Alright.

18:43.816 --> 18:45.335
It's done, Doctor?

18:47.175 --> 18:48.215
Is my injury a problem?

18:48.975 --> 18:50.816
Your eyes are fine.

18:50.975 --> 18:51.817
Just a minor wound.

18:51.817 --> 18:53.335
Visit the surgery for treatment.

18:54.696 --> 18:55.696
I told you,

18:56.095 --> 18:56.976
it would've healed

18:56.976 --> 18:58.015
in half an hour.

19:00.255 --> 19:01.255
Thank you, Doctor.

19:01.776 --> 19:02.456
Thank you.

19:02.536 --> 19:02.856
Bye.

19:02.856 --> 19:03.856
Okay.

19:04.896 --> 19:05.576
Medical records.

19:05.736 --> 19:06.736
Alright.

19:16.736 --> 19:17.736
What?

19:17.935 --> 19:18.576
You idiot.

19:18.576 --> 19:19.576
A man's badge of honor.

19:24.576 --> 19:25.576
Crazy.

19:41.015 --> 19:42.015
Guess who I saw?

19:43.055 --> 19:44.536
So rashly.

19:44.536 --> 19:45.536
Who did you see?

19:46.175 --> 19:47.896
Chen Luzhou came to our hospital again.

19:48.576 --> 19:49.055
No.

19:49.375 --> 19:52.255
It's the guy
who sent the red envelope last time.

19:52.255 --> 19:53.816
Got his eye hurt playing basketball.

19:53.816 --> 19:54.816
I took a look for him.

19:54.896 --> 19:55.896
No.

19:56.656 --> 19:57.656
What's the matter?

19:59.255 --> 20:00.656
If I'm not mistaken,

20:04.175 --> 20:05.015
it's this person.

20:05.095 --> 20:05.776
Come on.

20:05.776 --> 20:06.776
See for yourself.

20:08.095 --> 20:09.816
Do you remember you said

20:10.416 --> 20:12.736
that if anyone
takes a liking to Yingying,

20:12.736 --> 20:14.776
you'd be the first
to take him to your eye doctor.

20:16.095 --> 20:17.095
Take a look.

20:17.295 --> 20:19.015
Here he comes.

20:19.255 --> 20:20.255
This...

20:20.696 --> 20:21.696
This is impossible.

20:21.776 --> 20:22.295
Just a joke.

20:22.295 --> 20:23.295
How is it impossible?

20:23.896 --> 20:24.536
Here.

20:24.776 --> 20:26.295
S-Send this photo

20:26.696 --> 20:27.295
to me.

20:27.456 --> 20:28.175
No need.

20:28.175 --> 20:28.975
See for yourself.

20:28.975 --> 20:29.936
- Just in Moments.
- I can't.

20:29.936 --> 20:31.255
I can't see her Moments.

20:32.616 --> 20:33.776
She blocked you?

20:37.416 --> 20:38.295
Wouldn't call it that.

20:38.295 --> 20:39.295
I'd call it...

20:40.375 --> 20:43.015
giving her enough space.

20:43.015 --> 20:44.215
What space?

20:44.215 --> 20:45.215
That's a black hole.

20:51.496 --> 20:54.175
(Congrats, Chen,
on taking the first step to growing up)

20:54.175 --> 20:56.175
(with your first fight.)

20:59.736 --> 21:02.055
Zhu Yangqi and Chen Luzhou
got into a fight with someone!

21:02.055 --> 21:03.055
Look.

21:06.175 --> 21:07.696
(Looks much better this way.)

21:08.496 --> 21:10.295
(Don't idolize me too much.)

21:10.696 --> 21:13.015
The two of you aren't that strong.

21:15.616 --> 21:16.616
Zhi,

21:16.736 --> 21:18.255
do you know why they fought?

21:18.656 --> 21:19.416
Don't want to know.

21:19.416 --> 21:20.416
I'm insisting you know.

21:20.975 --> 21:23.055
Zhu Yangqi said Chen Luzhou

21:23.055 --> 21:24.816
was upset
when he saw Feng Jin hanging out

21:24.975 --> 21:26.135
with us in Moments.

21:26.856 --> 21:28.656
He went into a rage
on the basketball court,

21:29.055 --> 21:30.576
and started a fight over a dispute.

21:32.255 --> 21:33.255
I want to ask,

21:33.696 --> 21:36.015
as the catalyst of this incident,

21:36.215 --> 21:37.416
what are your thoughts?

21:38.135 --> 21:39.175
Childish.

21:41.135 --> 21:42.616
(Can you post your own hand?)

21:42.776 --> 21:43.776
(Back off.)

21:44.696 --> 21:46.736
(Why the hurry?
I haven't posted your abs yet.)

21:50.335 --> 21:52.536
(Anything less than an eight-pack
doesn't count as abs.)

21:54.776 --> 21:55.536
What did you reply?

21:55.736 --> 21:56.375
Let me see.

21:56.736 --> 21:57.816
(Eight-pack abs.)

21:57.816 --> 21:58.856
(500 if you want)

21:59.015 --> 21:59.537
(a photo.)

21:59.537 --> 22:02.175
Naked Score Guy 713.

22:02.816 --> 22:04.416
Zhi, what kind of people are you adding?

22:04.416 --> 22:05.416
Look at you.

22:05.935 --> 22:06.935
There really is abs?

22:07.736 --> 22:08.736
I want to see too.

22:08.975 --> 22:09.975
Not this one.

22:10.536 --> 22:11.616
This one is quite delicate.

22:11.896 --> 22:12.896
No touching allowed.

22:13.095 --> 22:14.456
So delicate.

22:19.696 --> 22:20.856
Love this trip.

22:21.375 --> 22:22.375
Cheers.

22:28.015 --> 22:30.015
Alright, stop drinking.

22:41.215 --> 22:42.295
This is for hitting me.

22:43.696 --> 22:44.255
I paid.

22:44.656 --> 22:45.295
Thank you, boss.

22:45.416 --> 22:46.416
Take care.

23:11.656 --> 23:14.616
What do you think it means
when a puppy wags its tail?

23:35.456 --> 23:36.456
Coming.

23:38.175 --> 23:39.536
You don't invite me to play games?

23:42.055 --> 23:43.255
Do you know how to play this?

23:43.255 --> 23:44.616
Come, I'll teach you.

23:52.344 --> 23:56.710
(Xu Zhi's Moments)

24:06.335 --> 24:07.335
Why is it her?

24:09.015 --> 24:10.015
What do you mean why?

24:11.135 --> 24:12.496
Are you pretending to be stupid?

24:14.335 --> 24:16.616
Over the years, many people liked you.

24:17.576 --> 24:18.576
Good-looking ones.

24:18.696 --> 24:19.975
Smart ones.

24:20.656 --> 24:21.656
So why her?

24:24.055 --> 24:25.295
Do you remember the four of us

24:25.295 --> 24:27.015
having supper together
for the first time?

24:29.616 --> 24:30.616
Why are you staring?

24:30.856 --> 24:32.135
My dad works in a hospital.

24:32.255 --> 24:33.656
He's seen a lot of troublemakers.

24:34.095 --> 24:36.055
Told me to develop good habits
from a young age.

24:36.536 --> 24:38.055
If I encounter a troublemaker,

24:38.255 --> 24:39.255
I must keep evidence.

24:40.776 --> 24:42.135
So friendly on our second meeting?

24:42.975 --> 24:44.295
I thought exchanging names

24:44.295 --> 24:45.335
made us friends.

24:51.736 --> 24:52.975
Really?

24:52.975 --> 24:54.536
Over something so minor.

24:55.335 --> 24:57.175
She was the first one to stand by me

24:57.456 --> 24:58.856
no matter what.

25:09.335 --> 25:11.135
(Fighting alone for so many years.)

25:11.416 --> 25:13.255
(What I want might be a bit greedier.)

25:13.896 --> 25:15.776
(It's passionate and unfaltering love.)

25:16.536 --> 25:17.576
(It's one of a kind.)

25:18.215 --> 25:19.255
(It must be me.)

25:20.175 --> 25:21.175
Speak up.

25:23.055 --> 25:24.295
How deep are you in?

25:26.015 --> 25:27.055
Will going abroad help?

25:28.215 --> 25:29.215
Like her when you back?

25:37.295 --> 25:38.335
Really hopeless.

25:38.975 --> 25:39.975
How about this?

25:40.055 --> 25:41.295
Discuss it with your parents.

25:41.295 --> 25:42.295
Why not just stay here?

25:44.616 --> 25:45.896
Even the underwear I wear now

25:45.896 --> 25:47.536
is chosen by my mom.

25:48.496 --> 25:49.816
What right do I have to say no?

25:53.896 --> 25:55.015
When will you return?

25:57.015 --> 25:58.015
Two years, I guess.

25:58.696 --> 26:00.055
I checked the courses there.

26:00.375 --> 26:02.255
I aim to earn all credits in two years.

26:03.175 --> 26:05.015
See if there's a chance to get a job,

26:05.335 --> 26:06.335
or a part-time job.

26:06.816 --> 26:08.095
I'll return once I'm set.

26:09.416 --> 26:10.536
Two years?

26:11.055 --> 26:13.135
It's too late.

26:15.416 --> 26:16.416
Then let it be.

26:17.576 --> 26:18.776
Anyway, I'm going abroad.

26:18.935 --> 26:20.215
No contact for years.

26:21.736 --> 26:22.736
She'll forget about me.

26:41.656 --> 26:42.656
What's up?

26:42.935 --> 26:44.896
De Sica's film
is going to be re-released.

26:45.776 --> 26:46.536
You free tonight?

26:46.536 --> 26:47.576
We'll go watch it.

26:47.576 --> 26:48.576
Sure.

26:48.896 --> 26:49.896
Let me see.

26:53.215 --> 26:54.215
There's no schedule.

26:56.736 --> 26:57.577
No problem.

26:57.577 --> 26:59.255
Art film doesn't have special effects.

26:59.696 --> 27:02.055
Watching it later on WeTV is also okay.

27:02.576 --> 27:03.576
Alright.

27:08.175 --> 27:09.175
I'm back.

27:13.055 --> 27:14.055
Come over here.

27:16.255 --> 27:17.255
What's up?

27:18.896 --> 27:20.135
Can't I just talk with you?

27:20.616 --> 27:21.616
Come.

27:22.335 --> 27:23.335
Sit here.

27:24.736 --> 27:25.736
Sit closer.

27:28.335 --> 27:29.335
Let me ask you.

27:30.335 --> 27:31.696
Am I your best friend

27:32.135 --> 27:33.135
in the world?

27:34.696 --> 27:35.696
Yes.

27:36.055 --> 27:37.295
Then, can we

27:37.616 --> 27:40.015
talk about everything without secrets?

27:41.335 --> 27:43.015
Yes, maybe.

27:45.015 --> 27:46.015
Who's this?

27:47.816 --> 27:49.015
I was wondering who it was.

27:49.135 --> 27:50.135
A friend.

27:50.215 --> 27:51.215
What kind of friend?

27:51.935 --> 27:53.776
Just met him, an art student.

27:54.295 --> 27:56.175
He's a bit mouthy

27:56.496 --> 27:57.496
and loves to brag,

27:57.896 --> 27:59.175
but he's a good person.

27:59.496 --> 28:00.975
He recommended I take the art exam.

28:01.375 --> 28:05.015
You're not doing retaking that art exam
because of him,

28:05.015 --> 28:05.617
right?

28:05.617 --> 28:06.975
Of course not.

28:07.255 --> 28:08.616
I'm retaking a year just to get

28:08.616 --> 28:10.255
into a top-tier art college.

28:10.935 --> 28:12.175
Are we the best friends

28:12.175 --> 28:13.215
in the world?

28:13.215 --> 28:13.936
Yes.

28:13.936 --> 28:15.095
Then tell me the truth.

28:15.095 --> 28:17.015
Are you in a relationship
with that "pig"?

28:17.015 --> 28:17.976
I...

28:17.976 --> 28:19.776
We are just good buddies.

28:19.776 --> 28:21.616
W-Who do you think you're grossing out?

28:21.776 --> 28:23.295
Besides, in this world,

28:23.295 --> 28:24.416
only I can call him "pig".

28:24.496 --> 28:25.496
You can't call him that.

28:25.856 --> 28:26.537
You are single.

28:26.537 --> 28:27.776
T-Then why block me

28:27.776 --> 28:28.935
from the group photo?

28:29.215 --> 28:30.295
Mr. Cai Binhong.

28:30.616 --> 28:32.696
I've blocked you from everything.

28:33.375 --> 28:34.375
True.

28:35.055 --> 28:35.457
Then,

28:35.457 --> 28:36.935
I'm your best friend in the world.

28:37.576 --> 28:38.015
I can know

28:38.015 --> 28:38.777
your everything.

28:38.777 --> 28:40.015
Why are you blocking me?

28:40.456 --> 28:41.256
Let's discuss.

28:41.256 --> 28:43.175
Can you not block me?

28:44.776 --> 28:45.776
Performance-based.

28:47.816 --> 28:48.975
How else can I perform?

28:49.776 --> 28:51.816
I'm your best friend in the world.

28:51.816 --> 28:52.856
We talk about everything.

28:52.856 --> 28:54.215
There are no secrets, right?

28:58.552 --> 28:59.265
(Cai Yingying, you win.
Click below to get your prize.)

29:01.856 --> 29:02.975
Who are you fooling?

29:04.984 --> 29:06.327
(Win)

29:11.896 --> 29:12.896
Zhi.

29:13.095 --> 29:14.095
Zhi.

29:15.295 --> 29:16.456
Let me show you.

29:16.776 --> 29:17.416
What is it?

29:17.536 --> 29:18.935
Restored Sunflower.

29:18.935 --> 29:19.975
Your beloved De Sica.

29:20.375 --> 29:21.256
None in Qingyi.

29:21.256 --> 29:22.416
I've checked it all.

29:22.416 --> 29:23.417
This must be fake.

29:23.417 --> 29:24.496
It's true.

29:24.656 --> 29:26.055
At first, I thought it was fake.

29:26.255 --> 29:27.255
Then I clicked in.

29:27.335 --> 29:28.576
It was successfully redeemed.

29:28.816 --> 29:31.095
The schedule and seat number
are clearly written.

29:31.175 --> 29:32.175
If you doubt me, look.

29:33.720 --> 29:35.456
(Sunflower, Movie ticket)

29:35.456 --> 29:36.536
Which cinema?

29:36.656 --> 29:38.416
Bohui Cinema, Hall No. 3.

29:49.736 --> 29:50.896
Zhi, this hall.

29:54.736 --> 29:55.736
Which row?

29:56.335 --> 29:57.335
Third row.

29:58.335 --> 29:59.335
It's starting.

30:00.215 --> 30:02.335
Seat 4, Row 3.

30:03.095 --> 30:04.215
Hurry up, Zhi.

30:37.784 --> 30:40.218
♪On a midsummer night♪

30:40.696 --> 30:45.272
♪The drowsy streetlights
softly start to mend♪

30:47.064 --> 30:50.264
♪The moonlight
penetrates the tree shades♪

30:51.032 --> 30:53.696
♪Chasing the distance
between you and me♪

30:53.696 --> 30:54.816
Zhi, I'll take a call.

30:57.304 --> 30:59.633
♪On the mountaintop
where the shooting stars pass♪

30:59.896 --> 31:01.720
♪The silhouette is frozen in eternity♪

31:02.456 --> 31:04.888
♪Fireworks, cicadas chirping,
heartbeat breathing♪

31:04.888 --> 31:06.511
♪The whole world pauses♪

31:08.184 --> 31:10.721
♪Messages connecting the universe♪

31:12.824 --> 31:14.816
♪Billions of shooting stars♪

31:15.480 --> 31:17.940
♪Following the path of the galaxy♪

31:18.072 --> 31:19.864
♪Landing in my heart's depth♪

31:30.456 --> 31:31.456
Chen Luzhou.

31:33.975 --> 31:34.975
Come here.

31:59.456 --> 32:01.816
(I've got to run. Something urgent.
Have fun watching.)

32:03.416 --> 32:04.616
You planned it?

32:36.632 --> 32:38.904
(Chen Jishen)

32:43.736 --> 32:44.736
Dad.

32:45.656 --> 32:46.696
Can you do me a favor?

32:47.896 --> 32:48.896
How did you know?

32:49.656 --> 32:52.416
Hardly anyone in Qingyi
knows about De Sica.

32:53.015 --> 32:54.095
Who else could it be?

32:55.496 --> 32:57.776
And also, your scam message.

32:57.776 --> 32:58.935
Could it be any faker?

32:59.856 --> 33:01.736
Only Yingying is willing to play along.

33:23.456 --> 33:25.536
Is your movie invitation still valid?

33:27.175 --> 33:28.175
Didn't you refuse?

33:29.375 --> 33:31.616
Besides,
you're an heir to Bohui Studios.

33:31.776 --> 33:32.896
You want me to take you?

33:34.175 --> 33:35.175
You're such a bad man.

33:38.255 --> 33:39.255
I am.

33:39.576 --> 33:40.576
Boring.

33:42.416 --> 33:43.656
Then what counts as exciting?

33:46.055 --> 33:47.656
If being fun is based on your criteria,

33:47.656 --> 33:48.656
you're pretty boring too.

33:50.055 --> 33:51.576
Alright, we're both boring.

33:52.255 --> 33:54.095
Watching a boring movie
with boring person

33:54.375 --> 33:55.375
is completely boring.

33:56.255 --> 33:57.255
I'm going home.

34:07.576 --> 34:08.656
Is there anything else?

34:11.696 --> 34:12.975
What counts as exciting?

34:14.416 --> 34:15.416
Is dating exciting?

34:17.736 --> 34:19.255
You think everyone wants to date you?

34:23.295 --> 34:24.295
Dating is also boring.

34:25.975 --> 34:26.975
What about kissing then?

34:27.255 --> 34:28.255
Is kissing exciting?

34:30.896 --> 34:33.215
Chen Luzhou, you can't handle it.

34:35.055 --> 34:36.456
Do you just want to play with me?

34:38.456 --> 34:39.656
Who can't handle it?

34:40.935 --> 34:42.335
Don't you ignore my WeChat?

35:00.536 --> 35:02.295
I can answer your previous question now.

35:05.536 --> 35:06.656
Dating is boring.

35:07.255 --> 35:08.375
Kissing is also boring.

35:09.015 --> 35:10.536
Dating and kissing are both boring.

35:11.215 --> 35:12.335
Not dating but kissing

35:12.935 --> 35:13.935
is really exciting.

35:15.095 --> 35:16.095
Look at those two.

35:34.055 --> 35:35.456
So, some things

35:36.416 --> 35:38.255
are completely useless
to care about too much.

35:40.656 --> 35:42.095
That's why you can't handle it.

35:46.015 --> 35:47.095
You want to play?

35:48.135 --> 35:49.135
Okay.

35:49.616 --> 35:50.616
Just don't cry.

35:54.335 --> 35:55.335
Don't worry.

35:56.215 --> 35:58.416
I'll happily see you off on your flight.

36:15.656 --> 36:17.055
Yingying, I'm back.

36:17.055 --> 36:18.055
Zhi.

36:18.375 --> 36:19.375
Come here quickly.

36:21.935 --> 36:22.497
What's wrong?

36:22.497 --> 36:23.536
Let me ask you.

36:23.536 --> 36:25.576
How are you feeling?

36:26.616 --> 36:29.375
You keep saying you're my 007,

36:29.536 --> 36:30.256
but what now?

36:30.256 --> 36:31.416
You betrayed me.

36:32.015 --> 36:33.576
Chen Luzhou sold me out?

36:34.015 --> 36:34.936
When he came to me,

36:34.936 --> 36:36.375
he promised to keep it a secret.

36:36.935 --> 36:38.616
A man's words are truly deceitful.

36:39.255 --> 36:40.335
And you still helped him?

36:40.896 --> 36:42.375
I was helping you, okay?

36:42.576 --> 36:45.295
Because you have a stubborn temper.

36:45.696 --> 36:46.856
A cold war feels good first,

36:46.975 --> 36:48.015
but it'll end in flames.

36:48.335 --> 36:49.776
And then someone will say

36:50.015 --> 36:50.897
they regret it.

36:50.897 --> 36:52.576
Once, there was a sincere relationship

36:52.576 --> 36:53.696
right in front of me.

36:53.975 --> 36:55.816
I didn't cherish it at the beginning.

36:57.975 --> 36:59.696
You should worry about yourself.

36:59.935 --> 37:00.776
Have you decided?

37:00.776 --> 37:01.776
Want to retake the class?

37:02.175 --> 37:03.175
I've decided.

37:03.416 --> 37:04.656
I'll take art exam next year.

37:05.015 --> 37:06.015
Meet you in Beijing.

37:06.696 --> 37:08.896
This time it won't just be
a passing fad, right?

37:08.896 --> 37:09.935
Absolutely not.

37:09.935 --> 37:10.935
I swear.

37:11.215 --> 37:12.816
That's not right.

37:13.215 --> 37:14.215
Really.

37:21.496 --> 37:22.935
Refine my will.

37:22.935 --> 37:24.496
Nail the second try.

37:27.776 --> 37:28.816
Today's task is complete.

37:29.175 --> 37:30.696
Thanks for joining my morning workout.

37:31.055 --> 37:32.656
Alright, I'm going back to study.

37:32.816 --> 37:33.816
You have to work hard.

37:33.975 --> 37:34.936
Don't study all summer

37:34.936 --> 37:36.015
and still be at "abandon."

37:36.335 --> 37:37.335
Don't worry.

37:37.935 --> 37:38.416
Bye-bye.

37:38.656 --> 37:39.656
Bye-bye.

38:02.295 --> 38:03.295
Secretly filming me?

38:03.776 --> 38:04.776
I did it openly.

38:05.175 --> 38:06.175
That's still not okay.

38:07.375 --> 38:08.736
I went to beach with Zhu Yangqi.

38:09.856 --> 38:11.576
I fell asleep on the beach for a while.

38:11.896 --> 38:13.816
He secretly took over 300 photos of me.

38:13.816 --> 38:15.856
He blackmailed me to pay.

38:17.055 --> 38:18.856
Or he'll send them
to my future girlfriend.

38:19.335 --> 38:20.335
Really?

38:20.576 --> 38:21.576
Does he still have them?

38:21.856 --> 38:23.416
Could it be cheaper for a friend?

38:23.696 --> 38:24.896
You can't figure this out?

38:25.696 --> 38:26.657
Free for my girlfriend.

38:26.657 --> 38:27.935
Once I'm asleep, she can look.

38:29.335 --> 38:31.095
Were the photos really ugly?

38:31.295 --> 38:33.175
Why would he use those photos

38:33.656 --> 38:34.896
to get rich?

38:35.456 --> 38:36.456
Very handsome.

38:37.576 --> 38:39.295
Anyway,
you probably won't get to see them.

38:40.856 --> 38:43.277
(Tattoo, 20 percent off for pairs)

38:44.215 --> 38:45.215
20 percent off.

38:46.856 --> 38:47.856
Do you want a tattoo?

38:49.375 --> 38:50.375
Can't I just think?

38:52.055 --> 38:53.776
What would it be if you got one?

38:55.215 --> 38:56.416
Three letters.

38:57.095 --> 38:58.215
C, L, Z.

39:01.375 --> 39:02.375
I suggest

39:03.656 --> 39:04.656
don't tattoo names.

39:04.736 --> 39:05.736
Don't use abbreviations.

39:05.975 --> 39:06.975
Why not?

39:07.335 --> 39:08.656
I want to tattoo a cherry.

39:09.095 --> 39:10.175
What do you think I meant?

39:10.456 --> 39:11.456
Chen Luzhou?

39:14.616 --> 39:15.816
I had a goal when I was a kid.

39:15.816 --> 39:18.576
It was to achieve cherry freedom.

39:18.816 --> 39:20.215
It means earning lots of money.

39:21.055 --> 39:22.456
Then why not tattoo money?

39:22.536 --> 39:23.536
Because it's illegal.

39:29.736 --> 39:31.576
(Feng Jin is going abroad next week.)

39:31.576 --> 39:32.776
(Dinner tonight.)

39:32.856 --> 39:34.015
(See you at 6 PM.)

39:35.215 --> 39:36.215
So soon?

39:38.496 --> 39:40.255
I thought it would be the end of August.

39:40.456 --> 39:42.456
Have you decided when to go abroad?

39:43.975 --> 39:44.975
Not yet.

39:48.896 --> 39:50.175
I can't go tonight.

39:50.456 --> 39:52.095
Need to do the hospital's promo video.

39:55.456 --> 39:56.616
I've finished eating, bye.

39:57.175 --> 39:58.335
Say hello to Feng Jin for me.

40:21.736 --> 40:23.975
What exactly is your relationship
with Chen Luzhou?

40:25.055 --> 40:26.055
Nothing.

40:26.616 --> 40:28.335
Sometimes you two are very ambiguous.

40:28.496 --> 40:29.736
And sometimes very distant.

40:29.896 --> 40:31.215
It confuses me.

40:31.576 --> 40:32.975
Are you two together or not?

40:32.975 --> 40:34.175
Come on, here.

40:34.496 --> 40:35.536
Sorry, we're late.

40:35.975 --> 40:36.255
Sit.

40:36.255 --> 40:37.255
Which two are together?

40:37.375 --> 40:38.055
Xu Zhi.

40:38.255 --> 40:39.255
You in a relationship?

40:40.335 --> 40:41.255
Not yet.

40:41.255 --> 40:42.095
Who said that?

40:42.095 --> 40:42.975
Xu Zhi is single.

40:42.975 --> 40:43.255
No.

40:43.255 --> 40:44.255
Come on, sit down.

40:47.576 --> 40:48.416
- Order.
- Order.

40:48.416 --> 40:49.776
Order whatever you like.

40:50.055 --> 40:50.576
Waiter.

40:50.935 --> 40:51.416
Some water.

40:51.416 --> 40:52.335
You order main courses.

40:52.335 --> 40:53.055
- We check this.
- Whatever.

40:53.055 --> 40:53.375
Okay.

40:53.696 --> 40:54.215
Listen to me.

40:54.576 --> 40:55.856
Wang Quan, that one on the left.

40:56.375 --> 40:58.175
He is particularly close with Tan Xu.

40:58.335 --> 41:00.135
Don't mention
what's between you and Luzhou.

41:01.656 --> 41:02.656
What are we eating?

41:04.816 --> 41:05.816
Listen to me.

41:06.175 --> 41:06.935
Don't fool me.

41:07.175 --> 41:08.175
When I came in,

41:08.375 --> 41:09.656
I clearly heard Yingying talk

41:10.456 --> 41:13.576
about two people's relationship.

41:22.215 --> 41:23.215
It's me.

41:24.616 --> 41:26.255
It's me who's in a relationship.

41:28.576 --> 41:29.856
Are you sleep-talking here?

41:29.856 --> 41:31.656
Can't we see if you're
in a relationship?

41:31.656 --> 41:32.736
Exactly.

41:34.175 --> 41:34.696
Come on.

41:34.816 --> 41:36.015
Let me introduce.

41:36.935 --> 41:37.935
This person here,

41:38.255 --> 41:40.935
is my girlfriend, Cai Yingying.

41:46.456 --> 41:47.456
Yes.

41:51.896 --> 41:52.896
Look.

41:53.095 --> 41:54.095
I told you so.

41:54.416 --> 41:55.656
What's there to hide?

41:55.896 --> 41:58.295
- Right?
- Yes. We've been together for ages.

41:58.456 --> 42:00.416
I originally wanted to keep it a secret.

42:00.416 --> 42:02.215
Didn't you catch us in the act?

42:02.215 --> 42:03.215
Yes.

42:03.295 --> 42:04.816
How did you manage this secrecy?

42:05.255 --> 42:06.015
We didn't notice.

42:06.015 --> 42:07.015
Nice job.

42:07.375 --> 42:08.616
- Nice job.
- I knew it.

42:09.536 --> 42:11.215
You hang out together every day.

42:11.576 --> 42:14.856
So, you've been having
a secret relationship?

42:15.496 --> 42:17.856
Zhu, you're something else.

42:17.856 --> 42:19.215
Keep it low profile.

42:19.816 --> 42:20.816
Yes.

42:21.015 --> 42:22.015
Come, show some respect.

42:22.856 --> 42:23.975
- Hello, Madam.
- Hello, Madam.

42:24.255 --> 42:25.696
Just call me Yingying.

42:26.935 --> 42:27.857
- To Madam.
- To Madam.

42:27.857 --> 42:28.896
Come.

43:03.496 --> 43:05.255
How is it? Had too much to drink?

43:27.896 --> 43:28.975
What's up with Xu Zhi?

43:29.496 --> 43:30.496
Had too much to drink?

43:31.776 --> 43:33.255
Enough.

43:33.776 --> 43:34.296
- You drunk.
- Stop it.

43:34.296 --> 43:35.536
Feng Jin had too much to drink.

43:35.536 --> 43:36.056
Come on.

43:36.056 --> 43:37.935
Fell into Xu Zhi's arms.

43:41.935 --> 43:42.935
Separate them.

43:43.255 --> 43:44.255
Separate them.

43:46.496 --> 43:47.576
Got it.

43:48.055 --> 43:48.296
Wait.

43:48.296 --> 43:50.584
Why don't you care about me?

43:51.295 --> 43:52.215
Care what about you?

43:52.215 --> 43:53.416
Why worry about you?

43:55.536 --> 43:56.536
Nothing.

43:56.776 --> 43:59.935
It's just that Cai Yingying and I
officially announced.

44:01.896 --> 44:02.896
You're drunk, aren't you?

44:08.095 --> 44:09.135
Stop worrying about me.

44:09.135 --> 44:10.175
Worry about yourself.

44:10.736 --> 44:11.776
Your backyard is on fire.

44:11.935 --> 44:12.935
Over.

44:46.936 --> 44:49.336
(Because the puppy is wagging its tail.)

44:49.336 --> 44:51.480
(The cheers for you will never stop.)

44:51.480 --> 44:53.752
(The rain in Qingyi
may continue to fall all year round.)

44:53.752 --> 44:59.763
(I tell you I like you
in the bustling crowd.)

45:00.865 --> 45:06.681
♪Like a cloud drifting away♪

45:07.233 --> 45:12.761
♪Freely crossing the vast sky♪

45:14.273 --> 45:18.721
♪The world is too quiet♪

45:19.713 --> 45:26.641
♪Amplifying all the sounds♪

45:27.553 --> 45:32.641
♪Who will visit me♪

45:33.697 --> 45:39.321
♪Treading carefully
into my personal space♪

45:40.065 --> 45:43.121
♪Turning the frozen loneliness♪

45:43.361 --> 45:48.681
♪Into concern and care♪

45:54.209 --> 45:59.321
♪Watching stars rise and fall♪

45:59.841 --> 46:05.681
♪Gently pushing me to tour your world♪

46:07.137 --> 46:10.521
♪Swirling into a vortex♪

46:10.657 --> 46:16.881
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

46:17.377 --> 46:20.321
♪The lonely clock♪

46:20.481 --> 46:25.081
♪A relentless pursuit, day and night♪

46:25.473 --> 46:28.721
♪Are we both♪

46:28.993 --> 46:32.521
♪Attracted to each other♪

46:33.665 --> 46:40.281
♪Falling into you♪

46:44.001 --> 46:49.801
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

46:50.657 --> 46:53.321
♪Just a few more embraces away♪

46:53.857 --> 46:58.481
♪From reaching eternity♪

46:58.881 --> 47:02.161
♪After rushing recklessly♪

47:02.369 --> 47:05.801
♪We approach each other♪

47:07.073 --> 47:10.681
♪Without turning back♪

47:12.065 --> 47:19.721
♪In your eyes, I see myself♪

47:20.353 --> 47:26.841
♪Falling into you♪
